{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37707","headline":"海棠 · 郑谷","name":"海棠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风用意匀颜色，销得携觞与赋诗。\n穠丽最宜新着雨，娇饶全在欲开时。\n莫愁粉黛临窗嬾，梁广丹青点笔迟。\n朝醉暮吟看不足，羡他蝴蝶宿深枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}